    <unit id="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>PopupConfirm combines a trigger control with a confirmation flyout. It is useful when an operation needs a quick second step but does not justify a blocking modal dialog.</source>
        <target state="translated">PopupConfirm 將觸發控件與確認浮層組合在一起，適用於需要快速二次確認、但不需要阻塞式模態框的操作。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="PageSubtitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Inline confirmation before a lightweight destructive or risky action.</source>
        <target state="translated">在輕量級危險操作或風險操作前進行就地確認。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
